# D3-MI-007: A hydrated patina mineral carries more than its copper and sulfate
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 30mL
add v1 langite 0.0002mol
add v2 water 30mL
add v2 brochantite 0.0002mol
measure v1 balance
measure v2 balance
add v1 HCl 0.0015mol
add v2 HCl 0.0015mol
particles v1
particles v2
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
inspect
